<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
Local model backing the hermes agent: Qwen3.6-35B-A3B (MoE, 3B active) served
by llama.cpp on Metal.

Install:
  cp org.hermes.llama-server.plist ~/Library/LaunchAgents/
  launchctl bootstrap gui/$(id -u) ~/Library/LaunchAgents/org.hermes.llama-server.plist

Measured on this box (24GB M4, llama.cpp build 1925) on 2026-08-28:
  ~28.7 tok/s generation at 128k context, flat across 16k..262k.
  KV is only ~1.9GB at 128k -- the hybrid SSM/linear-attention layers give most
  of the 40 blocks constant state instead of growing KV.
  Prefill of hermes's ~16.4k-token system prompt takes ~54s cold; llama-server
  caches prompts, so later turns in a session skip most of that.

--parallel 1 matters: llama-server defaults to n_slots=4, which sizes the KV
pool for four concurrent requests. hermes is a single agent, so the default
would waste 4x the KV for nothing.

Bound to 0.0.0.0 because hermes runs in Docker and reaches the host via
host.docker.internal, not loopback. Started by launchd rather than from a shell
so it is not attributed to com.apple.sshd-session, which on this headless box
is subject to the Local Network permission grant.

Do NOT pair this with a keep-warm pinger. llama-server holds the model resident
for its whole lifetime -- there is nothing to keep warm, and that pattern is
what wedged the flint router at a 262k context.
-->
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>Label</key>
    <string>org.hermes.llama-server</string>
    <key>ProgramArguments</key>
    <array>
        <string>/Users/trevor/Projects/llama.cpp/build/bin/llama-server</string>
        <string>--model</string>
        <string>/Users/trevor/Models/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-UD-IQ3_XXS.gguf</string>
        <string>--alias</string><string>qwen36-35b-a3b</string>
        <string>--host</string><string>0.0.0.0</string>
        <string>--port</string><string>8090</string>
        <string>-ngl</string><string>999</string>
        <string>--ctx-size</string><string>131072</string>
        <string>--parallel</string><string>1</string>
        <string>--cache-type-k</string><string>q8_0</string>
        <string>--cache-type-v</string><string>q8_0</string>
        <string>--jinja</string>
    </array>
    <key>RunAtLoad</key>
    <true/>
    <key>KeepAlive</key>
    <true/>
    <!-- A crash-loop on a 12GB model would thrash the box; back off between
         restarts instead of retrying immediately. -->
    <key>ThrottleInterval</key>
    <integer>30</integer>
    <key>StandardOutPath</key>
    <string>/tmp/hermes-llama-server.log</string>
    <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
    <string>/tmp/hermes-llama-server.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
